---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | KB Compressor" description="Privacy policy for KB Compressor.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Your images</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          KB Compressor does not upload, store, or transmit the images you compress. All
          compression happens locally in your browser using the HTML Canvas API. There is no
          server-side component that ever receives your image data &mdash; the file you
          choose stays on your device throughout.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may use a privacy-respecting analytics tool (such as Google Analytics) to
          understand aggregate traffic &mdash; for example, which pages are visited and how
          often. This does not include your uploaded images, and does not identify you
          personally. Analytics tools may set cookies or use similar technology in your
          browser; you can block these using your browser's privacy settings.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Advertising</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          KB Compressor may display ads served through a third-party provider (such as Google
          AdSense) to help cover hosting costs. These providers may use cookies to serve ads
          based on your visits to this and other sites. You can opt out of personalized
          advertising through your browser or via
          <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-indigo-600 underline dark:text-indigo-400" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Settings</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">No accounts, no data collection forms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          There is no sign-up, login, or account system. We don't collect your name, email
          address, or any other personal information through use of the compressor tool
          itself.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If this policy changes &mdash; for example, when analytics or advertising is
          actually enabled &mdash; this page will be updated with a new "last updated" date.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions about this policy can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:contact@pixtokb.com" class="text-indigo-600 underline dark:text-indigo-400">contact@pixtokb.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
